            <ArticleTitle>Benchmarking for unrelieved pain in a postanesthesia care unit.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>20-3</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The problem of unrelieved pain in the PostAnesthesia Care Unit (PACU) is an outcomes management concern. This article discusses the steps taken by the PACU staff to establish a benchmark for unrelieved pain and to evaluate the effect of the Multidisciplinary Pain Management Initiative (MPMI) action plan on the outcomes of length of stay and cost.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
